<title>COLOMBIA: Colombian Energy Minister to visit Britain, Sweden.</title>
<headline>Colombian Energy Minister to visit Britain, Sweden.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Energy and Mines Minister Rodrigo Villamizar will visit Britain and Sweden next week in a bid to lure new foreign investment into Colombia's energy sector.</p>
<p>The government announced earlier this month that it plans to raise at least $1.28 billion by mid-December through an ambitious privatization program featuring the sale of four electrical power plants and its 47.7 percent stake in one of the world's largest nickel producers.</p>
</text>
